# Keeps plans/active/ present in Git when no story is open.
#
# This directory is part of the story lifecycle defined in ADR-0001
# (docs/architecture/decisions/0001-plans-directory-structure.md) and is
# linked from AGENTS.md, .agents/rules/code_quality.md, docs/REMEDIATION_PLAN.md
# and plans/PHASE-I-NOTES.md. Git does not track empty directories, so without
# this placeholder those links break and `pnpm check:docs` fails in CI whenever
# the active queue is emptied.
#
# Do not delete. Open stories are added here as <id>-<slug>.md.
